        "review": "There are things i really love about this game. I like that you can walk around the table. the online is a lot of fun. Lots of classics but UNFORTUNATELY I can no longer support this game due to the heavy use of AI generative images. As an artist I find this very disappointing. I love pinball. Pinball machines are a work of art, but once you slap on AI generative images it looses its soul. I don't care if you're a small team. Hire a real artist to join the team and feature their work. Imagine being able to say 'and real human art by...' on your machines. \n\nDO BETTER ZACCARIA",
